# --- Exceptions -----------------------------------------------------
# These specific workbooks are hand-maintained master data the running
# app reads at startup/request time (trackingserver.js, emailtrackingserver.js).
# They are NOT generated output, so they must ship with every deploy.
# A directory-level ignore (nova-crm-project/data/ above) stops git from
# even checking per-file exceptions inside it — so we have to un-ignore
# the directory first, re-ignore everything else in it, then allow just
# these two files back in.
!nova-crm-project/data/
nova-crm-project/data/*
!nova-crm-project/data/UK_SUBCONTRACTOR_PROSPECT_MASTER_FINAL.xlsx
!nova-crm-project/data/SUBCONTRACTOR_PROSPECT_MASTER.xlsx

!AI_EmailAutomation2026/EmailAutomation2026 (2)/EmailAutomation2026/EmailAutomation/Data/Email_Tracking_NEW.xlsx


